 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"What's something you're good at that nobody here knows about? Trust me. Mostly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Noted. Filing that under 'extremely useful.' The village needs that. — or so they tell me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Found something. Follow it to the moot."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Said. At the moot. Let the fire decide what it means."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "«สวัสดี! คุณ...ชื่ออะไร?»"
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "«ใช่ๆ เธอพูดถูก.» (you catch 'พูดถูก' — spoke right) They nod back, slowly."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They glance toward their own thoughts; the exchange is winding down."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I keep expecting to see them by the fire. Then I remember. Don't make me regret saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You walk to the hollow with Liam. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "«ดีใจที่เจอคุณ จริงๆ นะ.» (you catch 'ดีใจ' — glad)"
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "«นั่นแหละ ตรงเป๊ะ.» (That's it, spot on. — you're fairly sure) They nod back, slowly. \"Okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "A final shared look — you both feel the talk running its course."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "The silence stretches a beat too long. They study their hands."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Well — Do you still sing? ...Sorry — weird question. I just realized I haven't heard anyone sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Ha! The creek concerts. I've heard those. Keep going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Under my breath, when I'm working. Old songs from Columbus, Ohio. The words are half gone but the tune holds. Tunes outlast everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Hah. Still on whether you still sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Jude is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I taste the water before the others drink at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Jude's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Greenbrier Shoots — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"When's the last time you really laughed? Famous last words.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Stealing joy. I like that. We should steal more of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Three days ago. Someone dropped a whole basket of tubers and we just stood there laughing. It wasn't even funny. It was the standing there. What could go wrong.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Right, because that always works — Still on the last time you laughed.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Since Jude died... I keep expecting to see Jude at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Jude said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Jude. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
